TY  - GEN
ID  - 0307092v2
AU  - Neumann, Walter D
TI  - Extended Bloch group and the Cheeger–Chern–Simons class
DA  - D:20181026
AB  - We deﬁne an extended Bloch group and show it is naturally isomorphic to H3(PSL(2, C)δ; Z). Using the Rogers dilogarithm function this leads to an ex- act simplicial formula for the universal Cheeger–Chern–Simons class on this homology group. It also leads to an independent proof of the analytic relation- ship between volume and Chern–Simons invariant of hyperbolic 3–manifolds conjectured in [16] and proved in [24], as well as eﬀective formulae for the Chern–Simons invariant of a hyperbolic 3–manifold.
ER  - 
